> Alright, so I accidentally summoned a peaceful Yeenoghu by sacrificing
> on an altar. He was bugging me by teleporting in my way whenever I
> walked around that level, so I invoked the Eye of Aethiopica while he
> was standing next to me, and teleported to Fort Ludios, a non teleport
> level. However he's still jumping all over the place. Is this a bug,
> or a feature?

He's a covetous monster. They can teleport to the upstairs on any
level, teleport or not. They can also teleport towards the Amulet of
Yendor or other unique item.

There's exactly *one* case where this works to your advantage: in
Moloch's sanctum, Rodney or a summoned demon lord will teleport inside
the inner sanctum, kill the high priest, and teleport back to you
afterwards, skipping you a huge battle with the high priest and his
cohorts.


